<title>USA: ITT denies Cuba telephone claim article.</title>
<headline>ITT denies Cuba telephone claim article.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp denied a report in the Miami Herald that said it is in talks with Italian telecommunications group Stet SpA over the possible purchase of ITT's ownership claim to Cuba's telephone system.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in no discussions whatsoever with Stet regarding our Cuban claim,&quot; a spokesman said, reiterating an ITT denial contained in the Miami Herald article.</p>
</text>
